OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree parade: Judge urges
OL,4,Aparties to reach agreement and 'step
OL,5,Aback from the abyss'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA judge hearing the legal challenge to
OL,8,Fthe Parades Commission's decision to
OL,9,Fallow the Orange Order to march on the
OL,10,Fmainly-nationalist Garvaghy Road in
OL,11,FPortadown has given the parties
OL,12,Finvolved a final opportunity to "reach
OL,13,Fan agreement" and "step back from the
OL,14,Fabyss.".
OL,16,FJudge Patricia Smyth said the issue the
OL,17,Fcourt is dealing with is of
OL,18,F"fundamental importance" to the entire
OL,19,Fsociety in Northern Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
