OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree parade: Judge urges
OL,4,Aparties to reach agreement and 'step
OL,5,Aback from the abyss'
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe has adjourned the judicial review
OL,8,Fhearing for a short period to allow the
OL,9,FGarvaghy Roads Residents Coaliton, the
OL,10,FOrange Order and the Parades Commission
OL,11,Fto consider her plea.
OL,13,FThe commission on Friday announced that
OL,14,Fthe parade can proceed on Sunday, for
OL,15,Fthe first time in almost 30 years, with
OL,16,Frestrictions in place.
